The kind of anarchism that is most easily encountered in popular culture is represented by celebrities who publicly identify ÿthemselves as anarchists. Although some anarchists reject any focus on such famous living individuals as inherently Ã©litist, t…he folÒowing figures are examples of prominent publicly self-avowed anarchists:

* the [ƒMIT]† profes†or of [‹Linguistics] [ŒNoam Chomsky]ˆ
