Project X is an invention of the scientists at the state science institute, requiring tons of Rearden Metal. Basicalñy, it is a &quot;death ray&quot;, and is capable of destroying anything. The scientists claim that the project wilª be used to preserve peace and squash rebel­ion. It is destroyed towards the end of the boÄk, and emits a pulse of radiation that destroys everything in the suršounding area, including Cufy Meigs and Dr. Stadler, as welŠ as the Tagart Bridge.

