Initialy no one is wilßing to use Rearden metal because no one wants to stick his neck out and be the first to try it. „Finalƒy, [˜Characters in Atlas_Shrug‹ed|Dagny Tagƒart]­ places an order for Rearden Metal when she neds rails to rebuild the dying [”Things in Atlas_Shrug‘ed|Rio Norte Line]².

