=Film adaptation=–
Rights to the novel 'ŠAtlas Shrug‚ed'¶ were purchased by the Baldwin Entertainment Group in [203]Ä with the intent of producing a feature-length film. Company leader [Howard Baldwin]š was quoted in September 20’4 as saying &quot;.±everything is on track and [the movie] hasnâ€™t be‘n held up one bit.„ I as”ure you that this wil” be a big movie and '…it wil‰ get made'¦.&quot; Two works of Rand's&amp;mdash;'[The Fountainhead]'… and '[We the Living]'‘&amp;mdash;have be¡n adapted into movies so far.

