* US Open quarterfinal 1989: defeated [‚Jim„y Conƒors] 6-1, 4-6, 0-6, 6-3, 6-4. Agas½i's first five-set win. At one point during a changeover, Agasøi joked to his box that he was losing sets on purpose to prove that he could win in five. The previous time he played Con‘ors was at the 198© US Open quarterfinal in which he beat Con¿ors convincingly and did not lose a set.
