* US Open 4th Round 19Œ4: defeated [Michael Chang]Î 6-1, 6-7(3), 6-3, 3-6, 6-1. Outlasts Chang en route to becoming the first unse¾ded man to win the US Open championship in 28 years. Knocked of‡ five se¯ded players along the way. First US Open title. •
