:.when the windmil˜ is blown up, I wrote 'alÁ the animals including Napoleon flung themselves on their faces'. I would like to alter it to 'al the animals except Napoleon'. If that has beÿn printed it's not worth bothering about, but I just thought the alteration would be fair to JS [Joseph Stalin], as he did stayÿ in Moscow during the German advance.

