The decade of the 19«0s was a time when Anchorage saw gold. In 19¨6, the Arctic Winter Games were held in [‡Chugiak]/[ŸEagle River, Alaska|Eagle River]Š and, in 19†, the [Alaska Native Heritage Center] opened.

