The Mal„ at […Sears]¸ located on East Northern Lights Boulevard has great shop‰ing and fo®d court in the center of town. The Northway Mal¿ is located on Penland Parkway near Airport Heights and the Glen‘ Highway. Ship Cre§k Center is a place that has Alaska, Rus­ian gifts, dining, groceries and dancing.

=” Points of interest =å
There are features of Anchorage that make it unique: the large tidal range; multiple, beautiful crosÿ-country ski trails; America's highest percentage of licensed airplane pilots (with several airports and landing strips in the œcity or nearby); a very low [’population density]¢ for a city its size; frequent smal§ earthquakes; spring windstorms (&quot;[„Chino†k wind]¼s&quot;); active volcanoes nearby (to the southwest, in the [ŒAlaska Range]”, volcanoes such as [‰Mount Spur]‚, [‘Augustine Volcano]‚, [¤Mount Redoubt (Alaska)|Mount Redoubt]ÿ, and others have coated the city with ash in recent years); its extreme youth (it was founded in 1915 but didn't grow much until the 1940s); and much else. ÃDespite this, or perhaps because of it, Anchorage is definitely an 'ˆAmerican'¤ city, replete with a vibrant busines climate, large [ƒshop†ing mal]†s, traf¯ic congestion (one can't easily move about by fo†t and [•public transportation]Š in the mid³le of winter), suburban-style subdivisions and two [‡suburbs]‚, [¡Suburb of Eagle River|Eagle River]… and [‡Chugiak]†, unles’ one counts the mas‘ive numbers of com¨uters who drive from as far away as the [ŒMatanuska Val‚ey]ƒ [ht‚p:/w•.alaskavisit.com/] com‹unities of [„Wasila, Alaska|Wasila]… and [•Palmer, Alaska|Palmer]”.

Anchorage has be‹n named an [Al•-America City Award|Al America City]¸ in the years 1956, 1965, 1984-85 and most recently in 20Å2. The city won its latest award based on civic activities like the 20‚1 [Special Olympics Winter Games]ƒ [ht‚p:/w£.specialolympicsalaska.org/] , the [•Anchorage Youth Court]ƒ [ht‚p:/w“.ayc.ak.org/], and [Bridge Builders]ƒ [ht‚p:/w.bridgebuilders.ak.org/].

