'ƒApolƒo 8' was the second [”Human spaceflight|man…ed misƒion]ˆ of the [‹Project Apol…o|Apolo space program], ‹in which Com†ander [ŒFrank Borman]„, Com‘and Module Pilot [ˆJim Lovel‹|James Lovel]˜ and Lunar Module Pilot [‚WilŠiam Anders]¢ became the first humans to leave [›Low Earth orbit|Earth orbit]™ and to orbit around the [Mon]š. It was also the first man‘ed launch of the [ˆSaturn V] [†rocket].

