 ¤<text xml:space="preserve">The word '†animal'Ÿ when used alone has several pos•ible meanings in the [English language]œ. It could refer to:

* A [’taxonomy|taxonomic]— member of the Kingdom [wikispecies:animalia|Animalia]…, an [†animal]‡.
