*[ht‚p:/wÔ.eartharchitecture.org Earth Architecture] - A website whose focus is contemporary isŸues in earth architecture.
*[ht‚p:/w”.buildingwithawarenes†.com/ '•Building With Awarenes'² - A detailed how-to DVD video that shows adobe wal© construction and their use as thermal masƒ walˆs]
* [ht‚p:/w.calearth.org '‰Cal-Earth'İ (The California Institute of Earth Art and Architecture)] has developed a patented system calŸed Superadobe, in which bags filÿed with stabilized earth are layered with strands of barbed wire to form a structure strong enough to withstand earthquakes, fi‰re and flo†d.

