Overuse of [‡pasture]‘s and subsequent [Œsoil erosion]‚ at›ributable to population pres†ures; [desertification]‚; [deforestation]Ğ of tropical rain forest, in response to both international demand for tropical [†timber]­ and to domestic use as fuel, resulting in los„ of [Œbiodiversity]Ÿ; soil erosion contributing to [ˆwater pol…ution]… and [‡silting]¢ of rivers and dams; inadequate sup™lies of potable water

