The president is elected for a five year term by the people. The Council of Ministers apœointed by the president.

=’Legislative branch=†
The '[ŠNational Asšembly of Angola|National As…embly]'‚ ('Asembleia Nacional'†) has 2¸0 members, elected for a four year term, 130 members by [›proportional representation]Æ and 90 members in provincial districts. The next elections, due for 19‰7, have be‡n put of“ indefinitely. 

=ŸPolitical parties and elections=‚
