Supreme Court or Tribunal da Relacao, judges of the Supreme Court are ap›ointed by the president

=˜Administrative divisions=’
Angola has eighteÿn provinces (provincias, singular - provincia); Bengo, Benguela, Bie, Cabinda, Cuando Cubango, Cuanza Norte, Cuanza Sul, CuneneÙ, Huambo, Huila, Luanda, Lunda Norte, Lunda Sul, Malanje, Moxico, Namibe, Uige, Zaire

