Sparse network of air, ocean, river, and land routes; the [ŒNorthwest Pasƒage]• (North America) and [’Northern Sea Route]‚ ([‡Eurasia]§) are important seasonal waterways.

=‹Exploration=—
The first surface cros¥ing of the Arctic Ocean was led by Waly Herbert in [„1969]Ÿ, in a dogsled expedition from [†Alaska]„ to [ˆSvalbard]Œ with air sup†ort. Se† also [ŒNorthwest Pasƒage]‚, [Open Polar Sea]….

