Racialy and ethnical¡y, the province is predominantly [˜Caucasian race|Caucasian]‚. 8©.8% of the population is either white or [§Aboriginal peoples of Canada|Aboriginal]¤ (Aboriginals represent a fairly smalÊ proportion of this percentage, however). This number is significantly smal§er in many of the cities, particularly [˜Calgary, Alberta|Calgary]… and [šEdmonton, Alberta|Edmonton]Â which are home to a much larger number of visible minorities.

