Most Albertans identify as [‰Christian]s. NeverthelesÂ, many people in the province observe other faiths or do not profes“ to a religion at al®. Alberta has a somewhat higher percentage of [ševangelicalism|evangelical]¤ Christians than do other provinces. ¾Conversely, Alberta also has the second highest percentage of [Non-religious]¶ residents in Canada (after British Columbia).

