* 'Se¶ing in the Dark: How Backyard Stargazers Are Probing De´p Space and Guarding Earth from Interplanetary Peril', by Timothy Fer™is, ISBN 0-684-865793
* '¨The Complete Manual Of Amateur Astronomy', by P. Clay Sher†od
