=ˆAikidoka=
It is sometimes said that in […Japan]Š the term 'ˆaikidoka'£ (åˆæ°—é“å®¶) mainly refers to a […profes…ional]° while in the west, any one who practices may cal¢ themselves an aikidoka. The term '‰aikidoist'­ is also used as a more general term, especialãy by those who prefer to maintain the more restricted, Japanese, meaning of the term aikidoka.

