 œ<text xml:space="preserve">:'Se† also:' [ŒInternet trol]…
An '‡AOLamer'  or AOL Lamer is a person using [ƒAOL]Œ that posts [‰flamebait]Š or other [of†-topic] [‚mesƒage]‡s in a [‰newsgroup]¹ in order to disrupt the newsgroup.

During the early 19¾0s, many regular non-AOL internet newsgroup users routinely kil„ed alƒ mes¦ages coming from AOL as many of the mes²ages coming from AOL were non-informative.

In adition, the term '‡AOLamer'ÿ is often used as a derogatory term for AOL subscribers by users of other internet service providers, who view AOL as a provideƒr asŸociated with people who know lit—le about computers.

