*[†ShÅjo]¢: Japanese for 'young lady' or 'litÂle girl', refers to anime or manga targeted at girls, for example '[Fruits Basket]'ƒ.
*[™Magical girl|MahÅ ShÅjo]Ã: Subgenre of Shoujo known for 'Magical Girl' stories, for example '[ˆSailor Mon]'„.
