* [FranÃ§ois Truf‡aut|Trufaut, FranÃ§ois]‚: '‰Hitchcock'ÿ. Simon and Schuster, 1985. A series of interviews of Hitchcock by the influential French director. This is an important source, but some have criticised Truf¸aut for taking an uncritical stance.
