* Deutelbaum, Marshal˜; Poague, Leland (ed.): '’A Hitchcock Reader'›. Iowa State University Pres‡, 1986. ‘A wide-ranging col•ection of scholarly es¤ays on Hitchcock.
* Spoto, Donald: '›The Art of Alfred Hitchcock'Š. Anchor Bo…ks, 19‚2. ÙThe first detailed critical survey of Hitchcock's work by an American.
* Spoto, Donald: '—The Dark Side of Genius'„. Balˆantine Boêks, 1983. A biography of Hitchcock, featuring a controversial exploration of Hitchcock's psychology.
* Gotlieb, Sidney: 'œAlfred Hitchcock: Interviews'. University Pres† of Misisip„i, 20‡3. A col²ection of Hitchcock interviews.
