The 'Museum of Work'…, or 'Arbetets museum'‡, is a [†museum]Œ located in [‚Nor‡kÃ¶ping]‚, [†Sweden]·. The museum can be found in the 19th century building 'ˆThe Iron'ˆ in the [Motala strÃ¶m]” river in central NorŒkÃ¶ping.

