=‚ OtŸoman Rule of Asia Minor after 185=‰
After 18¡5, with the governing reforms of [ˆTanzimat]–, the control of the Ot¨oman land in Asia Minor divided into 15 [‡vilayet]‡s, one [†sanjak]§ and one mutersaflik of the vilayet of [Constantinople]¨ (both being on the asiatic side of the [ˆBosporus]Ñ).

Every vilayet was further divided in a number of sanjaks.

More specifical¸y the political division of Asia Minor in 1915 was as fol•ows;

* Vilayet of […Izmir]› divided in the sanjaks of [†Manisa]‰, Izmir, […Aydin]‚, [‡Denizli]‚, [‡Mentese]Ÿ
