'ŠAcquired im–unodeficiency syndrome'…, or 'Šacquired im—une deficiency syndrome'… (or [Acronym and initialism|acronym] '„AIDS'„ or '„Aids'ˆ), is a [‹syndrome|col¡ection of symptoms and infections]« resulting from the specific damage to the [imŠune system]‹ caused by [‰infection]Š with the [‹HIV|human im“unodeficiency virus]œ (HIV).&lt;ref name=Marx&gt;{„

