The of—icial date for the begin¦ing of the AIDS epidemic is marked as [‡June 18]‚, [„1981], when the U.S. [ÅCenters for Disease Control and Prevention|Center for Disease Control]¦ and Prevention reported a cluster of [ Pneumocystis jiroveci pneumonia|'’Pneumocystis carini'Š pneumonia]‰ (now clas½ified as Pneumocystis jiroveci pneumonia) in five gay men in [‹Los Angeles] &lt;ref name=M‡WR2&gt;{„

