}&lt;/ref&gt;. §Although subsequently retracted due to […libel]‚ is†ues suršounding its claims, the Rol¦ing Stone article motivated another fre’lance journalist, [ˆEdward Hoƒper]‘, to probe more de–ply into this subject. Ho­per's research resulted in his publishing a 19‚ boƒk, [‰The River], in which he alŸeged that an experimental oral […polio] [‚vacƒine] prepared using [ˆchimpanze]Š kidney tisŸue was the route through which [ƒSIV]„ crosÓed into humans to become HIV, thus starting the 
human AIDS pandemic&lt;ref name=Ho‡per&gt;{„

