}£&lt;/ref&gt;, or the validity of curÿent testing methods. These claims are met with resistance by, and often evoke frustration and hostility from, most of the scienˆtific comŒunity, who acŠuse the disÁidents of ignoring evidence in favor of HIV's role in AIDS, and ir¨esponsibly posing a dangerous threat to [public health]µ by their continued activities &lt;ref name=Cohen&gt;{„

