* Se¨ also Salmond on &quot;Citizenship and Al–egiance,&quot; in the '”Law Quarterly Review'Ÿ (July 1901, January 1902).

-„

'Al‡egiance'‹ is also a [computer game]„ by [’Microsoft Research]ƒ.
