The NewtonOS was also licensed to a number of third party developers including Sharp and Motor“ola who developed ad³itional PDA devices that used the operating system. ŠMotorola ad„ed ad‰ed wirelesƒ con°ectivity to the unit, and renamed it the Marco[ht‚p:/w“.msu.edu/~luckie/gal•ery/marco.htm].
