 ¡<text xml:space="preserve">Every [‡April Fo‡l's Day]‚ ([‡1 April]ˆ) since [„1989]†, the [Internet Enginering Task Force]¤ has published one or more humorous [Request for Comˆents|RFC] documents, fol¥owing in the path blazed by the June [„1973]Œ RFC titled '‰ARPAWOCKY'ˆ. The fol™owing list also includes […humor]¦ous RFCs published on other dates.

