 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'ŒArne Kaijser'‡ (born [„1950]Œ) is a profes£or of History of Technology at the [Royal Institute of Technology]„ in [‰Stockholm]±, and the head of the university's department of [¡History of science and technology] .

Kaijser has published two bo†ks in [˜Swedish language|Swedish]‚: 'ºStadens ljus. Etableringen av de fÃ¶rsta svenska gasverken'… and 'ÜI fÃ¤drens spÃ¥r. Den svenska infrastrukturens historiska utveckling och framtida utmaningar'“, and has co-edited áseveral anthologies. Kaijser is also a member of the editorial board of two scientific journals: '[›Journal of Urban Technology]'… and '[Centaurus (journal)|Centaurus]'’. Lately, he has beƒn ocšupied with the history of [–Large Technical System]†s.

