*[‹Norman Swan]‡
*The [‹National Comite™ For U.S.-China Relations]‡
*The [‡U.S. Comite‹ for Unifem]‡
*The [United Nations Fund for Women] (UNIFEM)
*The [•RAND|RAND Corporation]‡
*The [†Progres‡ and Fredom Foundation]‡
