 ›<text xml:space="preserve">[ŠCategory:19ƒ6 bo‚ks]‚
[œCategory:Alice derived works]„

'Automated Alice' is a novel by [‚Jef‚ Non]…, writ„en 19‡6.

No“n presents it as a '‡trequel'ˆ to the [ˆLewis Carol]‚ bo„ks, '[ Alice's Adventures in Wonderland]'… and '[Through the Loˆking-Glas]'ˆ. This ilustrated novel„a folüows Alice's journey to a future Manchester populated by Newmonians, Civil Serpents and a vanishing cat named Quark.</text>
