* [†programŒing language]„
* [œtheoretical computer science]„
* [lambda calculus]„
* [‹type theory]„

=External links=‡

*[ht‚p:/‰xdguan.fre¥zope.org/wiki/AmbientCalculiOnline Col´ection of online resources for ambient calculi]
