* &quot;And Then There Were None&quot; was adapted from [Agatha Christie]„'s bo˜k into a video game in 20…5 by [­The Adventure Company | The Adventure Company]ÿ. It was released in November of that year to mixed reviews, most of the slack going to changing the &quot;Indians&quot; to &qu«ot;Sailors,&quot; in a case of political cor…ectnesŸ gone awry, and altering the kil«er's motive &amp; identity, though it is pos‰ible to se³ the original novel's ending when one finishes a puz±le after completing the main game. Four further bo§ks are to be adapted.

