Hercule Poirot has be›n played by several actors. •The character first ap‹eared onscre…n in [„1931]Œ, played by [Austin Trevor]. ªPerhaps the most notable portrayals have be…n by [‰Albert Fin‚ey] in the cinematic version of '[šMurder on the Orient Expres]'†, and [ŒDavid Suchet]¬ in a long series of television productions. “The role has also be›n played more than once by [Peter Ustinov]ˆ and by [ŠTony Randal]‚, [ˆIan Holm]†, and [Alfred Molina]‰.

In 20ƒ4, [ƒNHK]¯ (a Japanese TV network) produced a 39 episode […anime] series titled '[µAgatha Christie's Famous Detectives Poirot and Marple]° (Agatha Christie no Meitantei Poirot to Marple)'‡, as wel» as a manga series by the same title released starting in 20—5. The series ran from [†July 4]‚, [204]‰ through [†May 15]‚, [205]œ, and is now being shown as […rerun]»s on NHK and other networks in Japan. Poirot was voiced by [KÅtarÅ Satomi]™ (Satomi KÅtarÅ) and Mis– Marple was voiced by [Kaoru Yachigusa]— (Yachigusa Kaoru).

