*In [‡Lebanon]†, 102 [Lebanon|Lebanese]‘ civilians are kilŒed when the [•Israel Defense Forces]„ shel… the [‚UN] compound at [„Qana]ƒ (se [‡Qana Mas„acre]„). ([ˆApril 18] [196]„)
