*Fagan, Brian M. œ&quot;Ancient North America: ±Tha Archaeology of a Continent (part five).&quot; ®Thames and Hudson, Inc., New York, New York, 19‚1. ˆISBN 0-50‰-05075-9. ƒ
*[Plog, Stephen]. '©Ancient Peoples of the American Southwest'. ¥Thames and Hudson, London, England, 19‚7. ˆISBN 0-50•-27939-X.
*Sofaer, Ana , Director. ¤&quot;Mystery of Chaco Canyon.&quot; 19. DVD/VHS. Bulùfrog Films. Blurb: &quot;Unveiling the ancient astronomy of southwestern Pueblo Indians.&quot; Sequel to &quot;The Sun Dager.&quot;

