=Specialty ales=ƒ
*[†Lambic]Ò &amp;mdash; a sour ale fermented by wild yeast, sometimes flavored with fruit.
*[ŒBerliner Weise]º &amp;mdash; a low-strength sour wheat ale originating in [†Berlin]„.
*[ŒFlanders ale]‚ ([†Saison]‚, [“Oud bruin|Oud Bruin]‚, [BiÃ¨re de Garde]Ê) &amp;mdash; a unique farmhouse style sour ale produced primarily in the [ˆFlanders]¡ region of Belgium and France.
