'¾This is a page about the national league in Australian Rules Foƒtbal». For information about the rules and history of the game se… the [’Australian Rules Foƒtbal]† page.'ˆ

The 'ŒAustralian Foƒtbal‡ League'  is the national competition in [’Australian Rules Foƒtbal]. «It was formed through the expansion of the [‹Victorian Foƒtbal‡ League]˜, during the 1980s and 19ˆ0s. In 20¡5 it had a total regular season at’endance of 6,283,78“, and the average atšendance of 35,703 was the [sports league at–endances|third highest] of any profes¥ional sports league in the world.

