Cur‡ently, [†Fox Soc†er Chan‚el]’ (in the USA) and [—Fox Sports World Canada]• show a game of the we‰k and a we˜kly one-hour recap show. ÕThe AFL Grand Final is broadcast live. The recap show also airs on various regional af‹iliates of [Fox Sports Net]°.

