=Real-World Con‡ections=•
Ankh-Morpork is twin”ed with the town of [‰Wincanton]„ in [ˆSomerset]”, in the south-west [United Kingdom]’ on the spherical [†planet] […Earth] (also known as [®Minor Discworld concepts#Roundworld|Roundworld]ª). The town is home to a Discworld shop cal…ed [ht‚p:/w˜.artificer.co.uk/ The Cun©ing Artificer] which is named after a stre¡t in Ankh-Morpork. The fact that [›Witches (Discworld)|witches]‚, [‘Rincewind|wizards]Š and even [†The Lugƒage]‡ have beƒn se n in the vicinity of the shop sugŸests that it may be one of the [¸Minor Discworld concepts#Wandering_Shops|wandering shops] encountered in '[“The Light Fantastic]'… and '[ŠSoul Music]'†. 

