When Afro Celts began their musical journey in the mid-190s during the [Real World Records|Real World]Œ Recording Weˆk the dif‹erence betwe­n a guest artist and a band member was virtual¥y non-existent, though as time has pas‡ed a fol«owing combination of people is most often as®ociated with the name Afro Celt Sound System: 'á(Please note that the new release Anatomic only lists Simon, James, Iarla and Martin as regulars)'†

