:; RefeŒrenced in : [‹Agathemerus]‚, [•Geographie informatio]Ñ
:; Authenticity : Likely

Some of Anaximander's ideas were also preserved in [ŒTheophrastus]Ä's (lost) history of philosophy, and re-quoted by later authors.

