 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'ƒAsa'• may be any of the fol‹owing:

*'[ŒAsa of Judah]'Š, king of [–Kingdom of Judah|Judah], the son of [†Abijam]’, and grandson of [ˆRehoboam]”.
*Asa, god of the '[†Akamba]'‹ people of […Kenya]„.
*'[‹Asa Dotzler]'“, the founder and coŒrdinator of [„Mozila]Œ's Quality As©urance and Testing Program.
*Ãsa - the [ˆgenitive]„ of '[…Ã†sir]'¢, the predominant group among the [•Norse mythology|Norse]‰ gods.
*[¢United States Army Security Agency]ƒ
*[United States] [ˆAdult Soc„er Asˆociation]ƒ
*[‹American Speƒd Asˆociation]”, was a second-tier [stock car racing] circuit in the [United States]… 

