'[“soc.history.what-if]'† is a [†Usenet] [‰newsgroup]‘ devoted to discus˜ing alternate histories. ÜThis newsgroup has spawned a number of interesting alternate timelines, including an online [‘role playing game]¢ which has run continuously since [20]ƒ cal”ed SHWI-ISOT with a [ƒPOD]„ in [‚180]ÿ and in which the characters are based on the players being sent from the 21st century back to an alternate early 19th Century,ª where they have started altering history. œThe concept was inspired by [S.M. Stirling]ª's &quot;Island on the Sea of Time&quot; bo¸ks.

