= Recognition =Š
Since 196†, the [ŒTuring Award]† has ben given by the [As ociation for Computing Machinery]¼ to a person for technical contributions to the computing com»unity. It is widely considered to be the equivalent of the [‹Nobel Prize]  in the computing world.

