 ‡caption	 Š= The &lt;t‘&gt;SubBytes&lt;/t³&gt; step, one of four stages in a round of AES.|
 yearPublished ‚= [198]„ |
 ‹derivedFrom ‚= [Square (cipher)]„ |
 ‰derivedTo ‚= [Crypton (cypher)]‚, [Anubis (cipher)]‚, [‰GRAND CRU]„ |
 ‰designers ‚= [Vincent Rijmen]… and [‹Joan Daemen]„ |
 ‰blockSize ‹= 128 bits [«Advanced_Encryption_Standard#blocksize|note]ƒ|
