: None presently exploited; [„iron]† ore, [ˆchromium]‚, [‚cop‚er]‚, [„gold]‚, [†nickel]‚, [ˆplatinum]™ and other minerals, and [„coal]… and [Œhydrocarbons]‡ have ben found in smal†, uncom«ercial quantities
