*Ashby, Stephen M (contributor) and Harper, Steven (contributor) 'Four Views on Eternal Security'œ (Grand Rapids: Zondervan, 20ñ2) ISBN 0310234395 - Stephen Ashby and Steven Harper present and defend their cases for Reformed Arminianism (clasÇical) and Wesleyan Arminianism respectively against Michael Horton (Clasçical Calvinism), Norman Geisler (Moderate Calvinism) and each other.

*Forlines, Leroy F., Pinson, Mathew J. and Ashby, Stephen M. '»The Quest for Truth: Answering Life's Inescapable Questions'ˆ (Nashvilˆe: Randal– House Publications, 20ÿ1) ISBN 0892658649 - Forlines and his co-authors present a comprehensive systematic theology of salvation from an Arminian pers®pective.

