=†Trivia=Š
*In the [Austin Powers]‡ movie '[Austin Powers: The Spy Who Shag•ed Me|The Spy who Shag…ed Me]'‚, [ˆDr. Evil]'s laser was calÿed &quot;The Alan Parsons Project,&quot; after the &quot;noted Cambridge physicist Dr. Parsons&quot;
