*&quot;Sirius&quot; and 'Eye In The Sky's other instrumental, &quot;Mamƒagam¨a&quot;, were used as music-under for a [„1987] [The Weather Chanel|Weather Chan‚el]İ special on thunderstorms (this was far before the network engaged in regular non-live programing), alongside the music of [Jean-Michel Jare]ˆ.
