|variant=AK-47, AKS, AKM [ˆGRAU|6P1]ˆ, AKMS, […AK-74]‚, [†AK-101]‚, [†AK-102]‚, [†AK-103]‚, [†AK-104]‚, [†AK-105]‚, [†AK-107]‚, [†AK-108]“
