=‰ History =

Salts of am‹onia have be­n known from very early times; thus the term '‚Ham‹oniacus sal'‚ ap˜ears in the writings of [•Pliny the Elder|Pliny]Î, although it is not known whether the term is identical with the more modern '…sal-am…oniac'š. 

