*[Waved Albatros] '„P. ir…orata'‚
*[”Short-tailed Albatros] '‹P. albatrus'‚
*[‡Black-fo‹ted Albatros] '‹P. nigripes'‚
*[Laysan Albatros] '„P. imˆutabilis'…

