Another '„Ahab' is known only as an impious [‡prophet]” in the time of the [®Babylonian captivity of Judah|Babylonian exile]‚ ('[Bo–k of Jeremiah|Jeremiah]'” 29:21).

Another '[‘Captain Ahab|Ahab]'£ is the monomanical captain of the [‡whaling] [„ship] '[™Pequod (Moby-Dick)|Pequod]' in the novel [‰Moby-Dick]†. 

