 Änames=Algol, Gorgona, Gorgonea Prima, Demon Star, El Ghoul, 26 Per, [Gliese-Jahreis catalogue|GJ]‚ 91ƒ0, [œHarvard Revised catalogue|HR]… 936, [‚Bon”er Durchmusterung|BD]’ +40&amp;deg;673, [™Henry Draper catalogue|HD]ˆ 19356, [§General Catalogue of Trigonometric Paral‰axes|GCTP]… 646.0‚, [©Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory|SAO]Œ 38592, FK5 1†, Wo 910, ADS 2362, WDS 03082+4057A, [‚Hip“arcos catalogue|HIP]ˆ 14576. }‚
