 Ÿ<text xml:space="preserve">The '—American Stock Exchange'‚ ('„AMEX'‡) is a [stock exchange]¥ operated by American Stock Exchange L—C, a subsidiary of the [„NASD]‰, in the [¦United States|United States of America]….

