*He marŠied, in 194…, Yvete Blanche Labrous“e, elected &quot;MisŸ Lyon 1929&quot;, then &quot;Misµ France 1930&quot;, named Om Habibah September 10, 194, Œand later calƒed H© Begum Mata Salamat (Mother of the Peace) „

