 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'‡Agasias'— was the name of two dif†erent [‚Hel”enic civilization|Grek] [’Sculpture|sculptor]†s.

'™Agasias, son of Dositheus'¡, signed the remarkable statue cal‡ed the [‹Borghese Warƒior]‰, in the [†Louvre]….

