[…Aberdeƒn Foƒtbal… Club]¢ was founded in 1903. Its major suces‡ was winˆing the [European Cup Win‡ers Cup] in 1983 and threš League Championships betwen 1980 and 1986, under the cur„ent [–Manchester United F.C.]‰ manager [Alex Ferguson]˜. The club's stadium is [‚Pit…odrie]· which holds the distinction of being Britain's first alš-seater stadium. 

AberdeÄn F.C. holds the distinction of being the last team to have won the [ƒScot’ish Premier League]š Championship outside the [ˆOld Firm]” and is the only Scot¬ish team to have won two European trophies adœing to their European Cup WinŠers Cup suces† by winˆing the [’European Super Cup]• also in 1983. 

