#[šAntipope Novatian|Novatian]‚, [ƒ251]‹&amp;ndash;[ƒ258]ƒ
#[Antipope Felix I‡|Felix I] 'á(confused with a martyr with the same name and thus considered an authentic pope until recently),' [35]‹&amp;ndash;[ƒ365]ƒ
