Alfred was born sometime betwe‚n [ƒ847]ˆ and AD [ƒ849]„ at [˜Wantage, England|Wantage] in present-day [‹Oxfordshire]™, the fourth son of King [Ethelwulf of Wes‚ex]® (Ã†Ã¾elwulf), most likely by his first wife, [†Osburh]‡. He suce‘ded his brother, [ŠEthelred I]œ (Ã†Ã¾elrÃ¦d I), as King of [‚Wes‚ex]… and [†Mercia]„ in [ƒ871]‰.

