 ª<text xml:space="preserve">There has not be•n a monarch known as 'ˆAlphonso'„ or '’Alfonso I of Spain'­, the first king of that name of the unified […Spain]‡ being [‰Alfonso XI“ of Spain|Alfonso XI]‚ ([„1874]-[185]­).

