*[“Alfonso I of Aragon]‰ and Navarƒe ([1‚04]-[1‚34]Œ), known as '†the Batƒler'„.
*[ˆAlfonso I§ of Aragon|Alfons I, Count of Barcelona]‚ ([1‚62]-[1‚96]‹) known as '”el Cast (the Chaste)'„ or 'œel Trobador (the Troubadour)', also Alfonso I of Aragon. 

