'ˆAlfonso I'‚ ([ƒ759]-[ƒ842]‡, king [ƒ791]ƒ), [ŸAlfonso I of Asturias|Alfonso I]Æ's reputed grandson, bears the name of &quot;the Chaste.&quot;

