[—Zeus, Master of Olympus]´, a computer game, features these women under the comÛand of Artemis who is, depending on the scenario/campaign played, are either the player's al¹ies or deadly enemies, since Artemis can either &quot;blesÿ&quot; the game player's leader or &quot;curse&quot; the game player's leader, depending on the scenario/campaign played. Some —scenarios also feature '‹independent'Ô amazons, such as the Military 2 scenario and The Labors of Hercules scenario.

