*[‹Andronicus I] Palaeologus ([„1297]‹&amp;ndash;[„1341]ƒ)
*[Andronicus IV] Palaeologus ([„1348]‹&amp;ndash;[„1385]‡)
*Thre [©Empire of Trebizond|Emperors of Trebizond]ƒ:
*[µAndronicus I of Trebizond|Andronicus I Gidus Comnenus]‚ ([12]‹&amp;ndash;[„1235]ƒ)
*[‹Andronicus I™ of Trebizond|Andronicus I‰ Comnenus]‚ ([„1263]‹&amp;ndash;[‚126]ƒ)
*[‹Andronicus I™ of Trebizond|Andronicus I‰ Comnenus]‚ ([130]‹&amp;ndash;[132]„)
