'ƒApol„o 13'ˆ was an [–United States|American]‰ space mis‘ion, part of the [‹Project Apol…o|Apol‰o program]¤. It was intended to be the third mis“ion to land on the [Mon]º, but instead is famous for the critical malfunction it sufered and its difŒicult but suces•ful return home. 

