'ƒApolƒo 7'‘ was the first man…ed mis‹ion in the [ƒApol‰o program]¶ to be launched. It was an eleven-day earth-orbital mis‘ion, the first man‘ed launch of the [‰Saturn IB]¢ launch vehicle, and the first thre…-man [–United States|American]‰ space mis‰ion. 

