'ƒApolƒo 9'‘ was the third man…ed mis‹ion in the [‹Project Apol…o|Apol‰o program]œ, a ten day earth-orbital mision launched [‡3 March] [„1969]–. It was the second man¹ed flight of the Saturn V launch vehicle and the first man‘ed flight of the [ƒApolo Lunar Module]Š (LM).

