*1865 - American Civil War: Confederate President [‚Jef‹erson Davis]› and most of his Cabinet fleœ the Confederate capital of [’Richmond, Virginia]„.
*[‚190]… The [‹Foraker Act]ƒ pas‹es through [†Congres]‰, giving [Puerto Ricans]‰ limited [‰self-rule]„.
