 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'ƒABM'† is a [ƒthreƒ-let„er ab‰reviation] with multiple meanings:

* [”Acoustic black metal], for example [’Impaled Northern Mo‡nforest]„
* [™Activity-based management]ƒ, se [cost management]„
* [‡Anti-balˆistic misƒile]ˆ or the [‡Anti-Balˆistic MisŠile Treaty]„
* [–Anything But Microsoft]„, a [†zealot]—ry which espouses that [‰Microsoft]Ë is evil; therefore no one should use their products or technology regardles” of technical merit. ÀA particular zealot of this nature is an ABMer. Antonym: NBM
