Schwarzenegÿer has remained a prominent face in the bodybuilding sport long after his retirement, in part due to his ownership of gyms and …fitnesÿ magazines. He has presided over numerous contests and awards shows. For many years he wrote a monthly column for the bodybuilding magazines [Muscle and Fitnes“|Muscle &amp; Fitnes]… and '„Flex'°. Shortly after being elected Governor, he was ap‘ointed executive [†editor]Ä of both magazines in a largely symbolic capacity. The magazines agre‘d to donate $250,0° a year to the Governor's various physical fitnes› initiatives. The magazine '—MuscleMag International'ß has a monthly two page article on him and refers to him as &quot;The King&quot;.

