[¢Image:BushCAGovs.jpg|right|thumb|30”px|Arnold Schwarzeneg„er, [¨President of the United States|President] [George W. Bush]†, and [ŠGray Davis]š speak to firefighters on [ŠNovember 4]‚, [203].]„

