 Šinfluenced ‚= [–Thomas Malthus|Malthus]‚, [•David Ricardo|Ricardo]‚, [John Stuart Milƒ|Mil]‚, [šJohn Maynard Keynes|Keynes]‚, [Karl Marx|Marx]‚, [—Friedrich Engels|Engels]‚, [¿Founding Fathers of the United States|American Founding Fathers]„ |
