Many of ASU's departments were ranked in the top 50 by [˜US News and World Report]… in 20Œ5.

The Col“ege of Education [ht‚p:/¯coe.asu.edu] was ranked 35th in the nation in 20ß5. Its program in counseling was ranked 12th in the nation, and its Education Policy Studies [ht‚p:/Îcoe.asu.edu/elps/] doctoral program was ranked 15th. Six out of nine of the Col…ege's ·specialty programs were ranked in the top 20.

The folowing graduate departments in […engine„ring]µ were listed with their respective rankings (out of 30“+ institutions):
