 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'‡Amalric'¤ is the name of several kings.

* [Amalaric|Amalric] - King of the [‰Visigoths]” from 526 to 531
* [–Amalric I of Jerusalem]ƒ - [¦kingdom of Jerusalem|King of Jerusalem]† from 1†62 to 1†74
* [ˆAmalric I of Jerusalem]ƒ - [‘King of Jerusalem]† from 197 to 1205
* [Amalric of Bena]› - French theologian ca. 120‡ AD
