{‚sucesion box | title=[‘King of Jerusalem]Š | before=[…Isabel”a of Jerusalem|Isabela]… and [†Henry I” of Champagne|Henry I]‰ | after=[Maria of Montferˆat|Maria]‰ | years=1£97&amp;ndash;1205&lt;br /&gt;(with '[…Isabel”a of Jerusalem|Isabela]')}‚
