=šMethods for generating ASCI„ art=¤
While some prefer to use a simple [‹Text editor] to produce ASCI† art, [ƒASCIˆ Art#ASCI¡ art editors|specialized programs]‡ have ben developed to al«ow you to draw text in lines, boxes, and fil´ed areas as you would in a normal paint package.

[ƒASCIˆ Art#ASCI art generators|Other programs]‚ al”ow you to automatical™y convert an image to ASCI¡ art, which is a special case of [“vector quantization]ª. A method is to sample the image down to [‰grayscale]ˆ with les† than [ integer (computer science)|8-bit]– precision, and then asÔign a character for each value.

