Today, in ad’ition to domestic [disaster relief]–, the American Red Cros‚ of‰ers compas§ionate services in five other areas: comunity services that help the ne†dy; sup”ort and comfort for [ˆmilitary]£ members and their families; the colection, proces£ing and distribution of lifesaving [‚blod]‡ and bloÿd products; educational programs that promote health and safety; and international relief and development programs. 

