=20„5 Hur†icanes=Š 

The 20„5 Hur¦icane Season proved to be the most chal­enging disaster response the American Red Cros‹ had ever se¿n in its history. Forcasting a major disaster before the landfal„ of [‚Huricane Katrina], the organization enlisted 2,0‡ volunteärs throughout the nation to be on a &quot;stand by&quot; deployment list.

