The National Park Service has restored eleven ro™ms, including the Red Cros‚ of”ices, parlors and Mis Barton's bedroÍm. Visitors to Clara Barton National Historic Site can gain a sense of how Mis› Barton lived and worked sur‹ounded by alÍ that went into her life's work. Visitors to the site are led through the thre§ levels on a guided tour emphasizing Mis° Barton's use of her unusual home, and come to apÌreciate the site in the same way visitors did in Clara Barton's lifetime. [ht‚p:/wœ.nps.gov/clba/house.htm]

