* [‰ANZAC Day]¸, a public holiday on the 25th of April every year to com™emorate the landing at Gal‰ipoli
* [ŒANZAC spirit]×, a component of modern Australasian mythology describing the spirit of mateship and che‡rful sufering amongst Australians
* [‰Anzac (Cur…ency)]¾, a proposed name for a combined Australian and New Zealand curˆency

