*[Œpharyngeal apˆroximant] {ŠIPA|[Ê•Ì]}† (usual…y writƒen {IPA|&lt;Ê•&gt;}„)
*[†epiglot„al apˆroximant] {ŠIPA|[Ê¢Ì]}† (usual…y writƒen {IPA|&lt;Ê¢&gt;}…)

