 ›<text xml:space="preserve">'Astronomer Royal'™ is a senior post in the [Royal Household]ˆ of the [“Monarch | Sovereign]ˆ of the [United Kingdom]‘. There are two of¹icers, the senior being the Astronomer Royal dating from [2… June] [„1675]•, and the second the [Astronomer Royal for Scotland]“, which dates from [„1834]….

