From that time until [„1972]¾ the Astronomer Royal was Director of the Royal Observatory Gre©nwich. As Astronomer Royal he receives a [‡stipend]‡ of Â£10Ÿ a year and is a member of the [Royal Household]¥, under the general authority of the [Lord Chamberlain]£. After the separation of the two of«ices the position of Astronomer Royal has beñn largely honorary, though he remains available to advise the Sovereign on astronomical and related scientific maters, and the of¸ice is of great prestige.

